        skos:definition        "Standardised scale for nephelometric measurement of turbidity calibrated against formazine solutions of different concentration and measured using a white light source at a 90 degree detection angle. Earlier measurements of turbidity tended to use NTU (sometimes also labelled STU or FTU) as the unit regardless of the measurement method."@en;
        skos:notation          "SDN:P06::USTU";
        skos:note              "accepted"@en;
        skos:prefLabel         "Nephelometric Turbidity Units"@en;
